          "title": "CROSS Joins, Self Joins and Join Mistakes",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. CROSS and self joins",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==CROSS JOIN== = every pairing, m × n rows",
                "No `ON` clause; use it to generate combinations",
                "Self join: same table twice, with {blue:aliases}"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "sql",
              "lines": [
                "SELECT e.name, m.name AS manager",
                "FROM emp e",
                "LEFT JOIN emp m ON e.manager_id = m.id"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Join mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Mistake",
                "Effect",
                "Fix"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Right-table filter in `WHERE`",
                  "LEFT becomes INNER",
                  "Move it to `ON`"
                ],
                [
                  "Non-unique join key",
                  "Fan-out inflates `COUNT`, `SUM`",
                  "Join on a unique key"
                ],
                [
                  "Missing `ON`, comma join",
                  "Accidental cross join",
                  "Add `ON` / `WHERE`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "One-to-many: 1 order × 3 items = 3 rows"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "LEFT JOIN filter",
              "text": "Filter the right table in ==ON==, not `WHERE`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "SQL Querying Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "SQL Querying Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Query Order",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{green:Written}: `SELECT` → `FROM` → `JOIN` → `WHERE` → `ORDER BY` → `LIMIT`",
                "{blue:Runs}: ==FROM== → ==WHERE== → ==SELECT== → ==ORDER BY== → ==LIMIT==",
                "An alias from `SELECT` works in `ORDER BY`, not in `WHERE`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "FROM",
                    "sub": "rows",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "WHERE",
                    "sub": "filter",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "SELECT",
                    "sub": "columns",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "ORDER BY",
                    "sub": "sort",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "LIMIT",
                    "sub": "cut",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. NULL",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Test with `IS NULL` / `IS NOT NULL`; `= NULL` never matches",
                "`COALESCE(x, 'n/a')` gives the first non-NULL value",
                "`NOT IN` with a NULL in the list returns ==no rows==",
                "Prefer `NOT EXISTS` over `NOT IN`"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Join Types",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Join",
                "Keeps"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`INNER`",
                  "matches only"
                ],
                [
                  "`LEFT`",
                  "all left rows"
                ],
                [
                  "`RIGHT`",
                  "all right rows"
                ],
                [
                  "`FULL`",
                  "all rows, both sides"
                ],
                [
                  "`CROSS`",
                  "m × n pairs"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Pitfalls",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`SELECT *` pulls unneeded columns",
                "`LIMIT` without `ORDER BY` returns arbitrary rows",
                "`WHERE` on the right table of a `LEFT JOIN` makes it inner",
                "Joining on a non-unique key duplicates rows"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
